      "bullets": [
        "Researchers chained a heap overflow vulnerability with identity SSO misconfigurations to gain unauthorized access to OpenAI internal source repositories.",
        "The attack highlights that standard enterprise IAM flaws and memory corruption bugs remain primary threat vectors against frontier AI developers.",
        "Protecting proprietary model weights and training codebases demands strict SSO federation boundaries and zero-trust internal network isolation."
      ]
